@startuml
' Daily report interview algorithm (v17)

title Daily Report Hearing Sequence (5min / v17)

actor User as U
participant "Dialogue LLM" as L
participant "Slot Manager\n(MVS)" as S
participant "Report Formatter" as F

note over L
Timebox: ~5 minutes
Priority: next+deadline -> blocker -> impact -> done
end note

L -> U: Kickoff: "今日はやったことを短く教えてください"
U --> L: Initial answer (normal / short / ambiguous)
L -> S: classify input type

alt Ambiguous (e.g. "いろいろやった")
  L -> U: 2-stage choice\n1) activity domain (4 choices)\n2) outcome type (4 choices)
  U --> L: selected choices
  L -> U: minimal concrete input\n"対象/変化" (10-20 chars)
  U --> L: concrete snippet
else Short (e.g. "進んだ" / "普通")
  L -> U: Q1 next+deadline (2 choices)
  U --> L: next selected
  L -> S: set next
  L -> U: Q2 blocker? (yes/no)
  U --> L: blocker status
  L -> S: set blocker
  L -> U: Q3 evidence? (can say / unclear)
  U --> L: evidence status
  alt evidence unclear
    L -> U: evidence type (code/docs/comms/decision)
    U --> L: evidence type
  end
else Normal
  L -> U: ask for top task + progress
  U --> L: task/progress
end

L -> S: fill required slots (next, blocker, impact)

alt impact missing or weak
  L -> U: D48 impact recovery\n"価値があったのは? 準備/リスク低減/判断/共有/なし"
  U --> L: selected value
  alt still none
    L -> U: D53 retry once
    U --> L: retry result
  end
  L -> S: update impact
end

L -> S: 4-question gate check\n(required 3/3?)
alt required slots done
  L -> U: optional done 1 item (if time > 60s)
  U --> L: done item
  L -> S: set done
else required slots not done
  L -> U: targeted補完質問 (1問)
  U --> L:補完回答
  L -> S: update missing slot
end

L -> S: early-close check (A+B or A+C)
L -> F: build adaptive daily report format
F --> L: report draft
L -> U: summary + final correction (max 1 point)
U --> L: correction or OK
L -> S: finalize

@enduml
